# Example project. Two development symlinks live in lib/:
#   lib/legal   → ../../.        this library
#   lib/ua_data → ../../../ua_data  the rate and CPI library
# A bare ".." in the link target is rejected (P2613). "../../." is the
# two-level form of "../." and is accepted as a development symlink
# (warning P2639, decision 136). The document imports
# lib/legal/legal and lib/ua_data/ua_data.
